{"artifact_id":"extract_d788506b0b542959c98a643b","byte_end":31191,"byte_start":28184,"format_id":"reviewed-html-paragraph-v1","locator":"S1.p2.1","original_html":"<p id=\"S1.p2.1\" class=\"ltx_p\">A key feature that sets this model apart from virtually all other new-physics scenarios, and motivates this search already with a partial run dataset, is the production cross-section\u2019s strong dependence on the proton\u2013proton centre-of-mass energy, <math id=\"S1.p2.m1\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"\\sqrt{s}\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><msqrt><mi>s</mi></msqrt><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{s}</annotation></semantics></math>.\nThis dependence causes the increase in <math id=\"S1.p2.m2\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"\\sqrt{s}\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><msqrt><mi>s</mi></msqrt><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{s}</annotation></semantics></math> from Run 2 of the LHC (<math id=\"S1.p2.m3\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"13\\penalty\\ \\textrm{TeV}\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo lspace=\"0.500em\" rspace=\"0em\">\u200b</mo><mtext>TeV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\penalty\\ \\textrm{TeV}</annotation></semantics></math>) to Run 3 (<math id=\"S1.p2.m4\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"13.6\\penalty\\ \\textrm{TeV}\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13.6</mn><mo lspace=\"0.500em\" rspace=\"0em\">\u200b</mo><mtext>TeV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13.6\\penalty\\ \\textrm{TeV}</annotation></semantics></math>) to enhance <math id=\"S1.p2.m5\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"\\sigma_{\\textrm{QBH}}\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><msub><mi>\u03c3</mi><mtext>QBH</mtext></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{\\textrm{QBH}}</annotation></semantics></math> by approximately <math id=\"S1.p2.m6\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"100\\%\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math> at <math id=\"S1.p2.m7\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"M_{\\textrm{th}}=6\\penalty\\ \\textrm{TeV}\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>th</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace=\"0.500em\" rspace=\"0em\">\u200b</mo><mtext>TeV</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\textrm{th}}=6\\penalty\\ \\textrm{TeV}</annotation></semantics></math> up to about <math id=\"S1.p2.m8\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"1000\\%\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\%</annotation></semantics></math> at <math id=\"S1.p2.m9\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"M_{\\textrm{th}}=10.5\\penalty\\ \\textrm{TeV}\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>th</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>10.5</mn><mo lspace=\"0.500em\" rspace=\"0em\">\u200b</mo><mtext>TeV</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\textrm{th}}=10.5\\penalty\\ \\textrm{TeV}</annotation></semantics></math> <cite class=\"ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite\">[<a href=\"#bib.bibx4\" title=\"\" class=\"ltx_ref\">4</a>]</cite>.</p>","parser_version":"1.0.0","purpose":"RESEARCH","review_status":"PROPOSED","schema_version":"1.0.0","source_hash":"6871595fe1a737fb5cdcc57f322626d870b24a7afc3060feb3ec4a9186c10444","source_id":"atlas_paper_v2","source_version":"2604.19495v2"}